---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact PRC" description="Contact Property and Rent Consult for questions about products, services, or partnership inquiries. Email, form, or WhatsApp — we respond within one business day.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="cite">Get in touch</span>
      <h1>Contact Property and Rent Consult</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Have a question about our products? Need consultation on a tenancy issue? Found an error in our resources? We'd like to hear from you. Reach out via email, form, or WhatsApp.</p>

      <div class="grid grid-2" style="margin-top:2rem; align-items:start; gap:2rem;">

        <form class="card" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true">
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
          <p><label for="name">Name</label><input id="name" name="name" required /></p>
          <p><label for="email">Email</label><input id="email" type="email" name="email" required /></p>
          <p><label for="subject">Subject</label>
            <select id="subject" name="subject" required>
              <option value="">Select a reason for contact</option>
              <option>Question about a product</option>
              <option>Interested in a consultation service</option>
              <option>Report an error or correction</option>
              <option>General inquiry</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </p>
          <p><label for="message">Message</label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required placeholder="Tell us what you need..."></textarea></p>
          <p><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send message</button></p>
        </form>

        <div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Direct contact</h3>
            <p><strong>Email</strong><br/>
            <a href="mailto:info@propertynrentconsult.com" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none;">info@propertynrentconsult.com</a></p>

            <p><strong>WhatsApp</strong><br/>
            <a href="https://wa.me/233208071633" rel="noopener" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none;">+233208071633</a><br/>
            <span class="small muted">Message the consulting desk anytime</span></p>

            <p><strong>Location</strong><br/>
            <span class="small">Accra, Ghana</span></p>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Response times</h3>
            <ul style="margin:0; padding-left:1.25rem; font-size:0.95rem;">
              <li>Email: Within 1 business day</li>
              <li>WhatsApp: Same day when possible</li>
              <li>Form submissions: Within 1 business day</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">We're most responsive Monday–Friday during business hours.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="notice">
            <p style="margin:0; font-size:0.95rem;"><strong>Product questions?</strong> Check the product detail page or Knowledge Hub article first—you might find the answer there. Each product has a "Learn more" section with detailed information.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <hr style="margin:3rem 0; border:none; border-top:1px solid #e0e0e0;"/>

      <h2>Other ways to reach us</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-3" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-top:0;">Directory corrections</h3>
          <p class="small">Found an error in the <a href="/resources/rent-control-offices/">Rent Control office directory</a>? Phone number changed? Location moved? Let us know and we'll update it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-top:0;">Product feedback</h3>
          <p class="small">Used one of our products? Have feedback on what worked, what didn't, or what you'd like to see? We listen and improve based on real user experience.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-top:0;">Partnership inquiries</h3>
          <p class="small">Interested in collaborating with PRC or carrying our products? Message us with details about your organization and ideas.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:3rem; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">What PRC is NOT</h3>
        <p style="margin:0; font-size:0.95rem;">PRC provides general guidance and documentation. We do not appear for or represent parties in Rent Control proceedings, and engagement with PRC confers no advantage in any matter before any Rent Control office. Our content is professional guidance, not legal advice. For matters requiring legal representation, consult a qualified attorney.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
